
# Registration module enhancements

Overview of frontend work for membership registration wizard, member payments, profile phone display, and supporting utilities.

## Scope

Both **frontend** and **backend** were updated. The frontend implements the user-facing wizard, live camera on web, receipt download, and profile phone country code. The backend validates, stores, and generates membership numbers and receipts.

## Routes to test

| Route | Feature |
|-------|---------|
| `/#/membership` | 5-step registration wizard |
| `/#/my-membership` | Membership number display |
| `/#/my-payments` | Payment history + download receipt |
| `/#/my-profile` | Mobile number with `+91` prefix |

## Frontend files touched

| Area | Files |
|------|-------|
| Registration wizard | `lib/features/membership/presentation/membership_screen.dart` |
| Registration API | `lib/core/network/registration_service.dart` |
| Membership / payments API | `lib/core/network/membership_api_service.dart` |
| Payments screen | `lib/features/dashboard/presentation/my_payments_screen.dart` |
| Profile screen | `lib/features/dashboard/presentation/my_profile_screen.dart` |
| Live camera (web) | `lib/core/utils/image_capture.dart`, `image_capture_web.dart`, `image_capture_stub.dart` |
| File download (web) | `lib/core/utils/file_download.dart`, `file_download_web.dart`, `file_download_stub.dart` |
| API base URL | `web/env-config.js` |

## UI behaviour summary

| Feature | Behaviour |
|---------|-----------|
| Plan CTA | Button text **Please Join** (plan price unchanged on card) |
| Details step | Practice location only (no separate city/location field); email; optional profile photo |
| Profile photo | Single **Add photo** → camera icon (live preview on web) or **Upload photo** |
| Complete step | Shows membership number, receipt number, debug password in dev |
| My payments | **Download receipt** for captured membership payments |
| My profile | Mobile shown and edited as `+91` + local number |
